<section id="compare" aria-labelledby="h-cmp">
  <h2 id="h-cmp" class="sec">Compare to a baseline</h2>
  <p class="sub">Delta is the row minus the baseline, labelled real only when it exceeds 2x the pass-to-pass std (same rule as <code>pwa compare</code>). The CSV stores only the overall std, so it is used for every family; when it is missing, the paper's pass variance (std 0.105) is used.</p>
  <div class="filters"><label>Baseline <select id="cmp-base"></select></label></div>
  <div class="scroll"><table id="cmp"></table></div>
  <p class="callout" id="cmp-note"></p>
</section>
